                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I’m Courtney Acamo, an intuitive healer, embodiment guide, ceremonialist, and sound priestess, fueled with a passion for the healing arts and women’s empowerment. I've spent the last decade traveling the globe, learning transformational tools, and studying healing modalities in diverse ranges of teachings and ancient wisdom traditions. For the last seven years, I have been cultivating a private healing practice that guides and empowers courageous souls through their unique evolutionary journey of healing, purification, and awakening."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Whether through ceremonies, retreats, individual mentorships, or healing sessions."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " I create powerful transformational containers for those",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "ready to awaken their creativity, heal from past traumas, reconnect with their innocence and joy, and remember their union with love and all of life.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I'm here as an ally in your liberation, leadership, and the embodiment of all that you are.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In Love and Devotion,",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Courtney"
                    }
                  ]
                },
